{"screen_name": "yonaga_san", "file": "yonaga_san-44c7bf", "name": "与永", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1946823560301006848/SHT8C_Df.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/738392678283411457/1611058634/1500x500", "description": "俺が葦名を生かす\n\nSkeb : http://skeb.jp/@yonaga_san\nBSK：https://bsky.app/profile/yonaga4747.bsky.social\nmail : yonayonayonaga＠gmail.com\n＠yonagann", "total_works": 67, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00"}], "novel": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 7000, "novel": 3000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 7000, "max": 7000}, "novel": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/yonaga_san", "name": "yonaga_san"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@Yonagan", "name": "Yonagan"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/7995098", "name": "7995098"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@yonaga_san/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d16ae745/uploads/origins/a283d03f-61e3-4011-8463-b2fe8f0b6b58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=966e497c2a4f9298ff72dae5729b908b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d16ae745/uploads/origins/a283d03f-61e3-4011-8463-b2fe8f0b6b58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=966e497c2a4f9298ff72dae5729b908b, https://si.imgix.net/d16ae745/uploads/origins/a283d03f-61e3-4011-8463-b2fe8f0b6b58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93894c4a7b57a1933b42e7367496e014 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d16ae745/uploads/origins/a283d03f-61e3-4011-8463-b2fe8f0b6b58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86577f97ee38c75158435c210ff1ebbe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの最近の作品をいくつか見て、とても感銘を受けたので、ぜひ依頼したいと思いました。\n\nエキゾチック・ダンサーの衣装を着たVtuberのLayna Lazarの作品をお願いしたいです。衣装には、彼女の顔にかかるシースルーのベールもお願いしたいです。最後に、ポーズと背景はお任せしますが、彼女が踊っている最中に、激しくも魅惑的な目で見る人を見ていたら、作品としてとてもうまくいくと思います。他にも何かアイデアがあれば、好きなようにやってください。\n\nレイナと衣装の参考資料を以下に追加しました。\n\n依頼を検討していただき、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RxezuOMZqXIsDDlhj0iSCsPpEJmUZ4pQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonaga_san/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b54aca56/uploads/origins/06d40f7e-eeb7-4ba2-8f8d-adbae0f8c59e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6b790b42d86ff17dbb8ba7878c02c5b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b54aca56/uploads/origins/06d40f7e-eeb7-4ba2-8f8d-adbae0f8c59e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6b790b42d86ff17dbb8ba7878c02c5b5, https://si.imgix.net/b54aca56/uploads/origins/06d40f7e-eeb7-4ba2-8f8d-adbae0f8c59e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5339dfbc3ff4e82fb06e5a045bee55ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b54aca56/uploads/origins/06d40f7e-eeb7-4ba2-8f8d-adbae0f8c59e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d2785401044823e320344fa254e91c38 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonaga_san/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6c9cb26/uploads/origins/027cc230-b89d-4971-909f-0fb035b14528?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&t